Yanis,

Congratulations on a triumphant acheivement and thank you for this great
resource. I have already been enjoying it greatly, and I plan to use it
every day.

I have found one slight technical problem though. When a user puts in an
apostrophe or quotation mark, the system shows it with a slash in front of
it. The first time I saw this I didn't know about the technical problem and
ranked a quotation down for having what I thought was a typo in it.

Until this is fixed, let's all be on the lookout to not make this mistake
when rating translations!

-epkat


